d [B1, B2, B3] chow. Discarding F4 maintains maximum flexibility for forming B4-B5-B6 or B7-B8-B9 chows, and potentially B4-B4 or B5-B5 pairs. The abundance of unshown B5 (4 copies) and B6 (4 copies) makes this the optimal strategic path.\n\nAnswer: Play F4"}
