e with no future potential since all B9 tiles are already shown (B9: 0 unshown). It cannot form any useful meld or sequence. Keeping my pairs (B3, B4, B5, B8, J2) gives me maximum flexibility to form pungs or adjust my hand structure based on future draws. B7 is the clear discard to maintain the most winning possibilities.\n\nAnswer: Play B7"}
